    "productGuideMissing is source-reviewed because the earlier document guard normally blocks this path. Rare nameUnit/ambiguous/invalidItem errors are covered directly through the original module API contract, not claimed as real UI branches.",
    "When the original draft state disables finish, tests invoke its existing captured callback to check the secondary guard; the real button remains disabled."
